Local changes: preserve foreground colors and attributes during selection;
ignore passive mouse movement; synchronize redraws; support gg; route gx
through the custom Fingers binary; use passive ANSI snapshots to avoid
scrolling full-screen applications on startup.

This is a vendored source snapshot with local modifications, not an unmodified
upstream release. The Rust source and lockfile are tracked in dotfiles.
